# Iron Charge: a gallop in the tradition of the New Wave of British Heavy Metal.
# An eighth plus two sixteenths (x.oo) on kick, bass and power chords: plain guitar
# hits are palm-muted chugs, '*' lets an open chord ring over the tom run.
#   street beat --pattern examples/patterns/iron-charge.groove

title   Iron Charge
bpm     176
key     Em
style   gallop
chords  E5 | D5 | C5 | D5

#         1    2    3    4      1    2    3    4
guitar  | x.oo x.oo x.oo x.oo | x.oo x.oo *... .... |
bass    | x.oo x.oo x.oo x.oo | x.oo x.oo x... .... |
kick    | x.oo x.oo x.oo x.oo | x.oo x.oo x... .... |
snare   | .... x... .... x... | .... x... xo.. .... |
ride    | o.o. o.o. o.o. o.o. | o.o. o.o. .... .... |
crash   | x... .... .... .... | .... .... x... .... |
tom     | .... .... .... .... | .... .... ..^^ ^oxx |
